WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.333 --> 00:00:08.500
We made it! Laverre City!

2
00:00:08.566 --> 00:00:11.766
- All right. Let's get to the Gym now.
- Pika!

3
00:00:11.833 --> 00:00:14.833
- You're really ready to move, huh?
- You bet I am.

4
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:19.100
If I can beat the Laverre Gym Leader, I'm gonna win my sixth Gym Badge.

5
00:00:19.166 --> 00:00:21.000
Two more, then the Kalos League.

6
00:00:21.066 --> 00:00:25.000
Mm-hm. Then let's hurry. The Gym is that way.

7
00:00:25.066 --> 00:00:26.200
- Awesome!
- Pika!

8
00:00:26.266 --> 00:00:28.000
Serena's ready to move too.

9
00:00:28.066 --> 00:00:30.500
Heh, you're that excited to see a Gym Battle?

10
00:00:30.566 --> 00:00:32.866
Of course. I'll be able to meet Valerie.

11
00:00:33.866 --> 00:00:36.000
- Who's Valerie?
- Look. Ta-da!

12
00:00:36.066 --> 00:00:38.233
Here she is. Isn't she great?

13
00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:40.500
Wow. Her clothes are so cute.

14
00:00:40.566 --> 00:00:42.733
That outfit is one of her creations.

15
00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:45.266
You see, Valerie is a famous fashion designer.

16
00:00:45.333 --> 00:00:46.766
Isn't that amazing?

17
00:00:46.833 --> 00:00:49.466
And she has her very own store in the Laverre City Gym.

18
00:00:49.533 --> 00:00:52.300
Hold on. Are you telling me what I think you are?

19
00:00:52.366 --> 00:00:54.800
Right. She's the Laverre Gym Leader as well.

20
00:00:54.866 --> 00:00:57.900
What do you know?

21
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.866
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

22
00:01:00.933 --> 00:01:02.633
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

23
00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:06.066
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

24
00:01:06.133 --> 00:01:07.533
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

25
00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:11.366
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

26
00:01:11.433 --> 00:01:14.633
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

27
00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:18.066
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

28
00:01:18.133 --> 00:01:22.033
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

29
00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:26.733
♪ The future of the world is in your hand! ♪

30
00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:29.000
♪ Pokémon! ♪

31
00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:36.900
A Fashionable Battle!

32
00:01:38.066 --> 00:01:40.500
Our heroes have arrived in Laverre City,

33
00:01:40.566 --> 00:01:44.033
where Ash will battle for his sixth Kalos Gym badge.

34
00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:47.700
Now that they know the Gym Leader, Valerie, is also a fashion designer,

35
00:01:47.766 --> 00:01:49.766
what kind of opponent will she be?

36
00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:57.466
Aah! Ta-da! It's the Laverre Gym!

37
00:01:57.533 --> 00:02:00.533
- Whoa.
- It's huge.

38
00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:02.100
-Pika!

39
00:02:02.166 --> 00:02:05.033
Wow. I finally get to meet Valerie.

40
00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:08.133
There's so much I want to ask her about the world of fashion.

41
00:02:08.199 --> 00:02:11.200
Ooh! Do you mind if I visit her store after your Gym Battle?

42
00:02:11.266 --> 00:02:14.000
- Of course not.
- Hooray!

43
00:02:14.066 --> 00:02:17.533
- 'Kay, Pikachu, let's go.
- Pikachu.

44
00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:19.566
Is anybody here?

45
00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:24.600
Do you think I should take this outfit now?

46
00:02:24.666 --> 00:02:26.433
We'd better hurry or we'll be late.

47
00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:31.433
Go ahead and take that package. And all the accessories too.

48
00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:32.833
- What's going on?
- Pika?

49
00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:35.166
They all seem really busy with something.

50
00:02:35.233 --> 00:02:38.066
Ah! They're all wearing Valerie's designs.

51
00:02:38.133 --> 00:02:39.433
They're so adorable.

52
00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:41.900
Please. I have to have a Gym Battle.

53
00:02:41.966 --> 00:02:43.633
No matter what.

54
00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:47.400
I'm very sorry. You see, the Laverre Gym is closed

55
00:02:47.466 --> 00:02:50.000
because we're having an event here today.

56
00:02:50.066 --> 00:02:51.633
There's really nothing I can do.

57
00:02:51.700 --> 00:02:54.800
- Oh, man, oh, man...
- Wait, are you serious?

58
00:02:54.866 --> 00:02:57.333
There's really no way to have a battle now?

59
00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:59.400
- Huh?
- I'm terribly sorry.

60
00:02:59.466 --> 00:03:02.266
Come on, please, I came all this way.

61
00:03:02.333 --> 00:03:06.266
- Are you here for a battle too?
- Yeah. I guess my timing's bad.

62
00:03:06.333 --> 00:03:07.966
- Hey.
- Huh?

63
00:03:08.033 --> 00:03:11.800
That girl's a keeper! Ooh!

64
00:03:11.866 --> 00:03:14.600
Please take care of my big brother. Waah!

65
00:03:14.666 --> 00:03:17.600
Ugh, please, I told you to stop this a million times.

66
00:03:17.666 --> 00:03:19.866
But, Clemont, she looks really, really, really nice.

67
00:03:19.933 --> 00:03:21.733
- I don't need your help.
- Heh.

68
00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:23.633
I can find my own girlfriend, thank you.

69
00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:25.100
- When?
- Hey!

70
00:03:25.166 --> 00:03:27.733
- Argh!
- It's the Lumiose Gym Leader.

71
00:03:27.800 --> 00:03:29.966
- Who, me?
- Huh?

72
00:03:30.033 --> 00:03:33.333
It's nice to meet everybody. My name is Sawyer.

73
00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:36.966
He came to challenge me at the Lumiose Gym not to long ago.

74
00:03:37.033 --> 00:03:40.666
Yeah. And I lost. But I really learned a whole lot.

75
00:03:40.733 --> 00:03:44.733
Nice to meet you. My name's Ash. This is my partner, Pikachu.

76
00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:46.566
- Pikachu.
- I'm Serena.

77
00:03:46.633 --> 00:03:49.400
- This is my sister.
- I'm Bonnie.

78
00:03:49.466 --> 00:03:51.500
- And this is Dedenne.
- Denne.

79
00:03:51.566 --> 00:03:52.566
Glad to meet you.

80
00:03:52.633 --> 00:03:55.833
So if you're challenging Gyms, how many badges do you have?

81
00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:57.366
So far, one.

82
00:03:57.433 --> 00:03:59.900
I really wanna get some more battling under my belt.

83
00:03:59.966 --> 00:04:02.000
So you've done well since then.

84
00:04:02.066 --> 00:04:05.566
His Treecko's quite a unique Pokémon and moves really well.

85
00:04:05.633 --> 00:04:07.900
Wow, Treecko's your partner, huh?

86
00:04:07.966 --> 00:04:11.400
Treecko was my very first Pokémon.

87
00:04:11.466 --> 00:04:13.933
But we've still got a lot of work to do.

88
00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:15.833
I really wanna get stronger

89
00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:18.899
and then go back and challenge the Lumiose City Gym again.

90
00:04:18.966 --> 00:04:20.866
You'd be welcome any time.

91
00:04:20.933 --> 00:04:24.000
Thanks. But what are you doing here now, Clemont?

92
00:04:24.066 --> 00:04:26.833
I left the Gym in my Clembot's able hands.

93
00:04:26.900 --> 00:04:30.233
That's because I decided to continue my journey with Ash.

94
00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:31.466
Hm?

95
00:04:31.533 --> 00:04:35.666
That way, I can get the chance to gain valuable experience watching Ash battle.

96
00:04:35.733 --> 00:04:38.633
Uh-huh. Ash is really incredible.

97
00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:41.466
- He beat Clemont too.
- Really? You did?

98
00:04:41.533 --> 00:04:44.966
- And he's got five whole badges.
- Five badges? Amazing!

99
00:04:45.033 --> 00:04:48.200
I'm gonna do my very best so I can catch up.

100
00:04:48.266 --> 00:04:51.766
Pika! Uh, I've still got a ways to go.

101
00:04:51.833 --> 00:04:54.800
Guess my sixth Gym Badge will have to wait until tomorrow.

102
00:04:54.866 --> 00:04:58.133
- So what do we do now?
- Pikachu.

103
00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:00.733
Well, we could go to Valerie's store first.

104
00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:05.300
- Good idea. Let's go.
- All right!

105
00:05:09.833 --> 00:05:12.866
- Wow, doesn't that outfit look great?
- Braixen!

106
00:05:12.933 --> 00:05:14.633
It sure does.

107
00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:17.933
- You'd look great in it too.
- You think? Thanks so much.

108
00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:20.600
- But, ah, that one's beautiful too.
- Ah!

109
00:05:20.666 --> 00:05:23.900
Those two certainly have a lot of energy, don't you think?

110
00:05:23.966 --> 00:05:25.266
They sure do.

111
00:05:25.333 --> 00:05:28.266
You know, I'm really glad they're having such a good time.

112
00:05:28.333 --> 00:05:30.733
- Yeah, me too.
- Pika.

113
00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:31.766
Hm?

114
00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:36.900
Sawyer, since we can't have our Gym Battles,

115
00:05:36.966 --> 00:05:40.166
- how about we practise some?
- Hey, that would be great.

116
00:05:40.233 --> 00:05:42.900
If it's all right with you, could we have a double battle?

117
00:05:42.966 --> 00:05:45.500
- I've never had one before.
- Sure thing.

118
00:05:47.333 --> 00:05:51.533
What do you think of those two? Aren't they totally perfect?

119
00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:53.600
I think they might work out.

120
00:05:55.733 --> 00:05:59.666
The double battle between Ash and Sawyer will now begin.

121
00:05:59.733 --> 00:06:01.900
All right, I choose you two.

122
00:06:03.833 --> 00:06:06.000
Now, I'm counting on you to win this.

123
00:06:06.066 --> 00:06:07.866
- Froga!
- Hawlucha!

124
00:06:07.933 --> 00:06:11.100
Sawyer, what about you? You'll be using Treecko, won't you?

125
00:06:11.166 --> 00:06:15.733
Yes, of course. And the other Pokémon is my secret weapon.

126
00:06:17.133 --> 00:06:19.300
- Treecko!
- Bagon.

127
00:06:19.366 --> 00:06:22.000
Yup, there's Treecko.

128
00:06:23.733 --> 00:06:26.000
Treecko. The Wood Gecko Pokémon.

129
00:06:26.066 --> 00:06:29.033
Numerous tiny spikes cover the bottoms of Treecko's feet,

130
00:06:29.100 --> 00:06:31.266
allowing it to walk on ceilings and walls.

131
00:06:31.333 --> 00:06:33.766
And that other one there is Bagon.

132
00:06:35.466 --> 00:06:37.400
Bagon. The Rock Head Pokémon.

133
00:06:37.466 --> 00:06:40.233
Because Bagon dreams of being able to fly,

134
00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:43.366
it regularly practises by leaping from cliffs.

135
00:06:43.433 --> 00:06:47.100
All right then, battle begin.

136
00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:50.933
- Bagon, Headbutt.
- Bagon!

137
00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:53.333
Hawlucha, meet it head-on with Karate Chop.

138
00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:54.433
Haw...

139
00:06:56.066 --> 00:06:59.766
lucha!

140
00:07:00.966 --> 00:07:04.166
-Hawlucha, you OK?

141
00:07:04.233 --> 00:07:07.200
You may have noticed my Bagon has a really hard head.

142
00:07:07.266 --> 00:07:11.600
Then check this out. Lots of Karate Chops.

143
00:07:11.666 --> 00:07:15.233
Lucha!

144
00:07:15.300 --> 00:07:18.066
Lucha, lucha, lucha, lucha, lucha, lucha!

145
00:07:18.133 --> 00:07:21.566
Lucha, lucha, lucha, lucha, lucha, lucha, lucha, lucha, lucha, lucha!

146
00:07:21.633 --> 00:07:23.300
Lucha, lucha!

147
00:07:26.066 --> 00:07:28.366
Whoa, Ash. That was pretty impressive.

148
00:07:28.433 --> 00:07:33.066
We keep on trying and we never give up. That's our battling style.

149
00:07:33.133 --> 00:07:34.233
Cha!

150
00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:37.200
I see. Well, we don't give up either.

151
00:07:37.266 --> 00:07:39.766
Treecko. Use Leech Seed, let's go.

152
00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:43.800
- Tree, tree, tree, tree, tree, tree, tree!
- Use Fire Fang.

153
00:07:43.866 --> 00:07:46.033
Bagon!

154
00:07:46.100 --> 00:07:48.433
Frogadier. Use Water Pulse.

155
00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:51.366
Frog, Frogadier!

156
00:07:53.266 --> 00:07:56.333
- Pika!
- That was great, Frogadier.

157
00:07:56.400 --> 00:07:57.700
- Dier.
- Ha-cha.

158
00:07:57.766 --> 00:08:02.766
You work perfectly together. That's what I call real teamwork.

159
00:08:02.833 --> 00:08:06.400
- You've taught me a lot. Thanks, Ash.
- Hm.

160
00:08:07.733 --> 00:08:11.133
I've got it. Wouldn't it be fun if I wore one of those dresses

161
00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:13.966
- when I appear in the Pokémon Showcase?
- Braix, braix.

162
00:08:14.033 --> 00:08:16.400
I think that's such a neat idea.

163
00:08:16.466 --> 00:08:21.133
Ash, what do you think? Huh? Where's Ash?

164
00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:25.233
- Huh? Look, Serena, over there.
- Huh?

165
00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:28.300
Right. Of course Ash is having a battle.

166
00:08:28.366 --> 00:08:33.566
- What else? That's what Ash does.
- Of course. That's our Ash.

167
00:08:33.633 --> 00:08:36.400
- So why don't we go over and watch it?
- Mm.

168
00:08:36.466 --> 00:08:38.866
Excuse us. Can we talk for a minute?

169
00:08:38.933 --> 00:08:40.966
- Huh?
- Sure.

170
00:08:41.033 --> 00:08:44.366
There's a little something we'd like to speak to the two of you about.

171
00:08:44.433 --> 00:08:48.200
- We hope you don't mind.
- Huh?

172
00:08:48.266 --> 00:08:49.833
Treecko, Bullet Seed.

173
00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:51.833
Treecko!

174
00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:53.700
- Dodge it.
- Frog.

175
00:08:54.666 --> 00:08:56.166
Smart choice.

176
00:08:56.233 --> 00:08:58.633
Grass-type moves work well against Water types.

177
00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:01.766
But that's only if they make contact.

178
00:09:01.833 --> 00:09:04.366
Now use Bullet Seed one more time.

179
00:09:05.333 --> 00:09:07.700
Get in there, Frogadier.

180
00:09:07.766 --> 00:09:12.566
It's gone. Aah! Up there.

181
00:09:12.633 --> 00:09:14.600
- Huh?
- Hm.

182
00:09:14.666 --> 00:09:17.233
- Treecko, Bullet Seed.
- All right, use Cut.

183
00:09:17.366 --> 00:09:19.600
Gadier, gadier, gadier, gadier!

184
00:09:19.666 --> 00:09:21.800
- Huh?
- Treecko.

185
00:09:23.766 --> 00:09:26.300
- Froga.
- Treecko!

186
00:09:26.366 --> 00:09:27.800
Treecko, no!

187
00:09:27.866 --> 00:09:29.566
Treecko.

188
00:09:29.633 --> 00:09:32.066
Treecko is unable to battle.

189
00:09:32.133 --> 00:09:35.133
Thanks, Treecko. Now take a nice rest.

190
00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:37.433
- That's how Ash battles.
- Huh?

191
00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:41.366
Match-ups don't matter, because he always comes up with something surprising.

192
00:09:41.433 --> 00:09:44.266
We do lots of special training and thinking on our feet.

193
00:09:44.333 --> 00:09:46.333
So then we can win, no matter what comes up.

194
00:09:46.400 --> 00:09:47.400
Pikachu.

195
00:09:47.466 --> 00:09:51.566
I see. So I guess that's how you're able to battle the way you do.

196
00:09:51.633 --> 00:09:53.533
I'll make a note of this experience.

197
00:09:53.600 --> 00:09:56.400
There must be an endless number of ways to battle.

198
00:09:56.466 --> 00:10:01.366
- Yup. So, what do you wanna do now?
- I wanna keep on battling.

199
00:10:01.433 --> 00:10:03.566
- Bagon, let's go.
- Ba!

200
00:10:03.633 --> 00:10:05.266
That's the spirit.

201
00:10:05.333 --> 00:10:06.733
-Huh?

202
00:10:06.800 --> 00:10:09.400
- Pi.
- Uh, hey, what's that?

203
00:10:09.466 --> 00:10:11.466
Pika!

204
00:10:11.533 --> 00:10:13.533
-Pika.

205
00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:14.933
-What's going on?

206
00:10:27.566 --> 00:10:29.133
What should I do?

207
00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:33.833
I get an important show and then this happens.

208
00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:36.833
Sylveon. Sylveon.

209
00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:39.833
Spritz. Spritz, Spritzee. Spritz.

210
00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:41.633
Thank you.

211
00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:44.833
Sylveon. Spritz, Spritzee. Spritzee.

212
00:10:44.900 --> 00:10:46.900
- Veon!
- Spritz, Spritzee.

213
00:10:46.966 --> 00:10:52.100
I know I have to do my best for all of you and for my fans waiting for me out there.

214
00:10:58.633 --> 00:11:02.166
Ms Valerie, please excuse me, but may we enter?

215
00:11:02.233 --> 00:11:03.900
Yes.

216
00:11:07.633 --> 00:11:10.766
V-Valerie?

217
00:11:10.833 --> 00:11:12.566
It's her.

218
00:11:12.633 --> 00:11:16.433
Ms Valerie, I was thinking of asking these two.

219
00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:18.866
Hm?

220
00:11:20.100 --> 00:11:23.033
Hm. They should be perfect. Good.

221
00:11:23.100 --> 00:11:26.000
Valerie, it's such an honour to meet you.

222
00:11:26.066 --> 00:11:29.266
I'm a huge fan of every one of your fashion designs.

223
00:11:29.333 --> 00:11:31.900
Really? Why, thank you.

224
00:11:31.966 --> 00:11:33.700
Aw. Of course.

225
00:11:33.766 --> 00:11:35.533
- That girl's a keeper.
- Huh?

226
00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:39.533
- Would you take care of my brother?
- I'm a keeper?

227
00:11:39.600 --> 00:11:43.233
It's nothing. It's nothing. Bonnie, stop it.

228
00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:46.033
Huh? But you can see how pretty Valerie is.

229
00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:49.033
Thank you, dear. Oh.

230
00:11:50.666 --> 00:11:54.066
A Spritzee. And a Sylveon.

231
00:11:54.133 --> 00:11:55.800
- Denne!
- Sylveon!

232
00:11:55.866 --> 00:11:59.466
Yes, a Dedenne. Dedenne's a Fairy type, just like you.

233
00:11:59.533 --> 00:12:03.033
De-de-de-de-denne-ne. De-de-denne-de-de-denne-ne.

234
00:12:03.100 --> 00:12:05.033
Ne. Denne-ne-ne!

235
00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:07.800
- Huh? What was that?
- Dedenne talk.

236
00:12:07.866 --> 00:12:10.100
- Veon, veon.
- Spritzee!

237
00:12:10.166 --> 00:12:12.200
Denne-ne-ne!

238
00:12:12.266 --> 00:12:14.800
You see, the reason I wanted you both to come here

239
00:12:14.866 --> 00:12:16.933
is I have a favour to ask of you.

240
00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:19.000
That is, if you wouldn't mind?

241
00:12:19.066 --> 00:12:22.000
Huh? Favour?

242
00:12:22.066 --> 00:12:25.200
Who's that Pokémon?

243
00:12:29.066 --> 00:12:31.866
It's Bagon.

244
00:12:31.933 --> 00:12:33.866
Bagon.

245
00:12:39.966 --> 00:12:42.800
- What's going on?
- I have no idea.

246
00:12:42.866 --> 00:12:43.900
Pikachu.

247
00:12:55.066 --> 00:12:57.533
Ladies and gentlemen, the time has finally come.

248
00:12:57.600 --> 00:12:59.700
We'll be presenting designer extraordinaire

249
00:12:59.766 --> 00:13:01.800
Valerie's newest collection.

250
00:13:01.866 --> 00:13:04.833
Uh, what did she just say they're presenting?

251
00:13:04.900 --> 00:13:08.700
It's a fashion show displaying Ms Valerie's newest design collection.

252
00:13:08.766 --> 00:13:10.866
- Fashion show, huh?
- Pika?

253
00:13:10.933 --> 00:13:12.800
And it's just about to begin.

254
00:13:15.366 --> 00:13:20.433
First, an elegant creation with an Azumarill pattern.

255
00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:22.700
-Pika.

256
00:13:26.766 --> 00:13:30.700
- This stuff sure is popular.
- Pikachu.

257
00:13:37.466 --> 00:13:40.633
Maybe we should tell Serena and Bonnie about this.

258
00:13:40.700 --> 00:13:41.900
They're not here?

259
00:13:41.966 --> 00:13:45.133
And next up, designs featuring the beautiful patterns

260
00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:46.900
of Florges and Chingling.

261
00:13:51.200 --> 00:13:53.466
- Denne-ne!
- Braix, braix!

262
00:13:55.733 --> 00:13:57.366
- Serena?
- Bonnie?

263
00:13:57.433 --> 00:14:01.433
- Look, it's Ash.
- Look, see? Aren't I cute?

264
00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:03.633
Bonnie, what in the world are you doing?

265
00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:04.966
I'm modelling, of course.

266
00:14:05.033 --> 00:14:07.433
Yes, I know that, but why are you modelling?

267
00:14:07.500 --> 00:14:10.833
I had no idea Serena and Bonnie were models.

268
00:14:10.900 --> 00:14:14.800
You're travelling with a Gym Leader and models! I'm completely jealous.

269
00:14:14.866 --> 00:14:18.433
No, not exactly. Hey, Serena, what's this all about?

270
00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:22.833
The actual models weren't able to make it today, and then they saw us.

271
00:14:22.900 --> 00:14:26.166
So Valerie asked if we wouldn't mind taking their places.

272
00:14:27.366 --> 00:14:31.800
Pika, Pikachu!

273
00:14:37.300 --> 00:14:41.366
- Aah! Valerie looks incredible.
- She does look incredible.

274
00:14:41.433 --> 00:14:44.300
- That's Valerie the Gym Leader.
- Pika.

275
00:14:45.833 --> 00:14:50.866
Hi, there. Thank you all so very much for coming to my fashion show today.

276
00:14:50.933 --> 00:14:54.966
Every one of my latest designs incorporates Pokémon motifs.

277
00:14:55.033 --> 00:14:57.533
That's because my philosophy has always been

278
00:14:57.600 --> 00:15:01.000
the true beauty can only be found in nature.

279
00:15:01.066 --> 00:15:05.800
Also, all of my creations are carefully designed to look their absolute best

280
00:15:05.866 --> 00:15:08.966
- when worn during battle.
- What did she just say?

281
00:15:09.033 --> 00:15:11.366
- It's finally starting!
- Huh?

282
00:15:16.933 --> 00:15:18.566
Huh?

283
00:15:20.133 --> 00:15:23.066
That one, the boy in the front.

284
00:15:24.033 --> 00:15:28.300
- You, with the orange tie.
- Uh, orange tie? You want me?

285
00:15:28.366 --> 00:15:31.200
Yes. Will you please come this way?

286
00:15:33.133 --> 00:15:36.533
- Sawyer?
- Pika?

287
00:15:39.333 --> 00:15:42.266
Uh, so what's this about?

288
00:15:43.866 --> 00:15:46.266
I would like to have a battle with you, right here.

289
00:15:46.333 --> 00:15:47.700
Here?

290
00:15:47.766 --> 00:15:50.300
Now, of course if it turns out that you defeat me,

291
00:15:50.366 --> 00:15:52.633
I'll gladly reward you with a Gym Badge.

292
00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:53.766
Really?

293
00:15:53.833 --> 00:15:56.333
- Ah!
- It's her custom.

294
00:15:56.400 --> 00:15:58.400
Valerie does this to demonstrate

295
00:15:58.466 --> 00:16:01.333
how her creations always look their best when worn in battle.

296
00:16:01.400 --> 00:16:03.133
This is my chance.

297
00:16:03.200 --> 00:16:07.066
I'll take everything I've learned and win that badge for sure.

298
00:16:08.866 --> 00:16:12.266
And now, the battle between Laverre Gym Leader Valerie

299
00:16:12.333 --> 00:16:15.066
and Sawyer the challenger will now get under way.

300
00:16:15.133 --> 00:16:17.033
I'm ready to go.

301
00:16:17.100 --> 00:16:18.833
This is a one-on-one battle.

302
00:16:18.900 --> 00:16:23.366
It will be over when either side's Pokémon is unable to continue.

303
00:16:23.433 --> 00:16:24.900
- Hey, Ash.
- Serena.

304
00:16:24.966 --> 00:16:27.500
- Sawyer's going to battle with Valerie.
- Huh?

305
00:16:27.566 --> 00:16:31.566
- Using the same rules as a Gym Battle.
- Sawyer can do it for sure.

306
00:16:31.633 --> 00:16:34.300
- Now, Bagon, let's go.
- Gon!

307
00:16:34.366 --> 00:16:37.300
I wonder what Pokémon Valerie's gonna use?

308
00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:43.300
Spritzee, come out.

309
00:16:45.300 --> 00:16:46.466
Spritzee!

310
00:16:46.533 --> 00:16:49.166
- Pika.
- I think I know that.

311
00:16:51.100 --> 00:16:53.133
Spritzee. The Perfume Pokémon.

312
00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:56.266
Spritzee gives off a fragrance that delights anyone who smells it,

313
00:16:56.333 --> 00:16:58.633
which changes depending on what Spritzee eats.

314
00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:02.966
- This could be very bad.
- What do you mean, bad?

315
00:17:03.033 --> 00:17:04.700
Bagon, use Dragon Breath.

316
00:17:04.766 --> 00:17:07.033
Bagon!

317
00:17:08.933 --> 00:17:12.266
Yeah. I landed the first attack. Huh?

318
00:17:12.966 --> 00:17:14.566
Spritzee!

319
00:17:14.633 --> 00:17:19.066
- How can it be? I'm sure it made contact.
- Zee, zee! Spritzee!

320
00:17:21.866 --> 00:17:24.300
- Pika.
- Ah, you see, Spritzee is a Fairy type.

321
00:17:24.366 --> 00:17:28.033
And Dragon-type moves have no effect at all on Fairy types.

322
00:17:28.099 --> 00:17:31.966
- That's right.
- So that means Bagon is in big trouble.

323
00:17:32.033 --> 00:17:34.366
This is going to be one tough battle.

324
00:17:34.433 --> 00:17:38.266
Let's see. Dragon-type moves don't work on a Fairy type.

325
00:17:38.333 --> 00:17:40.866
I'll be sure to make a note of this experience.

326
00:17:40.933 --> 00:17:43.700
- Look at Ms Valerie.
- So beautiful.

327
00:17:43.766 --> 00:17:47.200
It's not enough. Not enough yet.

328
00:17:47.266 --> 00:17:51.400
- Not enough for my beautiful battle.
- Now, try this. Headbutt.

329
00:17:51.466 --> 00:17:53.533
Bagon!

330
00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:56.766
- And this. Continuous Headbutt.
- Bagon!

331
00:17:56.833 --> 00:18:01.300
- Bagon! Gon!
- Spritzee! Spritzee!

332
00:18:01.366 --> 00:18:03.800
- Pika!
- Spritzee never wastes any movement.

333
00:18:03.866 --> 00:18:07.366
But how? It dodged every single one of them.

334
00:18:07.433 --> 00:18:10.100
- Spritz!
- Now, I think that it's our turn...

335
00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:16.466
to make this battle beautiful.

336
00:18:16.533 --> 00:18:19.800
- Spritzee. Let's go.
- Spritz! Spritzee!

337
00:18:19.866 --> 00:18:24.800
- Don't let it get away. Headbutt.
- All right. Dazzling Gleam.

338
00:18:24.866 --> 00:18:27.466
Spritz!

339
00:18:27.533 --> 00:18:29.866
- So much...
- So bright!

340
00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.433
Do you see that?

341
00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:36.500
-Ba!

342
00:18:36.566 --> 00:18:38.233
Bagon, no!

343
00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:42.633
Bagon is unable to battle. The match goes to Gym Leader Valerie.

344
00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:45.200
- She beat him!

345
00:18:45.266 --> 00:18:48.100
- Valerie's so cool.
- Unbelievable.

346
00:18:48.166 --> 00:18:51.433
Bagon, you battled really hard.

347
00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:56.200
Hm?

348
00:18:58.500 --> 00:19:03.866
- Thank you.
- Hm. Thank you very much.

349
00:19:03.933 --> 00:19:06.766
- Valerie, you're so amazing.

350
00:19:16.900 --> 00:19:18.600
Valerie, you're so cool.

351
00:19:18.666 --> 00:19:21.833
- I love you so much!

352
00:19:22.633 --> 00:19:27.333
So that's the Gym Leader I have to face. I've got it.

353
00:19:33.266 --> 00:19:37.433
I learned so much today. I would challenge her again for sure.

354
00:19:37.500 --> 00:19:40.700
- That's the spirit.
- Good luck, Sawyer.

355
00:19:40.766 --> 00:19:42.800
- Man, that was good.
- Huh?

356
00:19:42.866 --> 00:19:45.933
Mm! All right, time for some special training.

357
00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:47.266
Ash?

358
00:19:47.333 --> 00:19:49.966
I wanna be ready for my Gym Battle with Valerie.

359
00:19:50.033 --> 00:19:53.066
And that's gonna be really soon. Let's go.

360
00:19:56.033 --> 00:20:00.333
- Hey, Ash? May I join in too?
- You bet. That'd be great.

361
00:20:00.400 --> 00:20:05.000
- You could really help us out a lot.
- Heh, thanks.

362
00:20:05.066 --> 00:20:07.133
Hey, what's the rush?

363
00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:10.433
It wouldn't hurt to take the time for a proper meal.

364
00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:14.500
Ash has trouble relaxing when he knows there's a strong opponent waiting for him.

365
00:20:18.566 --> 00:20:20.033
Huh?

366
00:20:20.100 --> 00:20:22.300
Well, if that's the case, I'll cheer them on.

367
00:20:22.366 --> 00:20:25.633
OK, I'm coming. Wait up.

368
00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:29.766
What, you too? Guess I'll go too.

369
00:20:31.366 --> 00:20:33.500
Mm. Hey, wait for me.

370
00:20:33.566 --> 00:20:36.933
Now that Ash has witnessed the incredible power of Valerie,

371
00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:38.233
the Laverre City Gym Leader,

372
00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:42.066
will he be able to defeat her and earn his sixth Kalos Gym Badge?

373
00:20:42.133 --> 00:20:45.866
The answer to come, as the journey continues.
